  "html": "<!-- TODO (EJ): add your voice — factual stub. (You confirmed this can be shared.) Draft. -->\n<p class=\"\">A network visualization and management app where users build graphs of nodes and links, then analyze the resulting structure with force-directed layout and graph metrics. The v2 rebuild adds AI-powered node generation and multiple import formats (Obsidian, Mermaid, CSV).</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The force layout re-distributing a funding network — scatter, settle, repeat\" class=\"\"><video class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm\" autoplay loop muted playsinline preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/video/upload/so_0,f_jpg,q_auto,w_1280/projects/connectology/force-demo.jpg\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/video/upload/q_auto/projects/connectology/force-demo.mp4\" aria-label=\"The force layout re-distributing a funding network — scatter, settle, repeat\"></video><figcaption class=\"\">The force layout re-distributing a funding network — scatter, settle, repeat</figcaption></figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The editor: force controls, WebGL rendering, and a network of nodes mid-layout\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/connectology/editor.png\" alt=\"The editor: force controls, WebGL rendering, and a network of nodes mid-layout\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/connectology/editor.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/connectology/editor.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/connectology/editor.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/connectology/editor.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"The editor: force controls, WebGL rendering, and a network of nodes mid-layout\" width=\"1440\" height=\"949\" style=\"--splay-rot:2.82deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1440×949\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">The editor: force controls, WebGL rendering, and a network of nodes mid-layout</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Your networks — the home shelf with live previews of each graph\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/connectology/networks-home.png\" alt=\"Your networks — the home shelf with live previews of each graph\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/connectology/networks-home.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/connectology/networks-home.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/connectology/networks-home.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/connectology/networks-home.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Your networks — the home shelf with live previews of each graph\" width=\"1440\" height=\"949\" style=\"--splay-rot:-2.02deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1440×949\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Your networks — the home shelf with live previews of each graph</figcaption>\n</figure>",
